            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"data\":{\"en_banners\":[],\"he_banners\":[],\"en_modals\":[{\"documentId\":\"pwhm4xcatmvsp7bxlvedeu4u\",\"internalModalName\":\"shavuot-2026-modal-example\",\"buttonText\":\"Donate Monthly\",\"buttonURL\":\"https://donate.sefaria.org/campaign/779365/donate?c_src=web\",\"showDelay\":1,\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-20T13:23:09.375Z\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"modalEndDate\":\"2026-08-11T03:45:00.000Z\",\"modalStartDate\":\"2026-08-04T04:45:00.000Z\",\"modalHeader\":null,\"modalText\":\"\\n\u201cWho is wise? One who learns from every person.\u201d \u2013 Pirkei Avot 4:1\\n\\nWe chose this verse for this year\u2019s tote bag because it is a reminder that wisdom is available to us all. Sefaria's mission is to help you gain wisdom from the breadth of the Jewish textual tradition. We are making it possible for more people to learn Torah than perhaps at any other point in Jewish history.\\n\\nThis Shavuot, start your monthly gift to power Jewish learning and claim your free tote bag!\\n\\nUpdate: We still need **100** new monthly donors to meet our goal! Give today to give back to Sefaria.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-04T23:00:26.301Z\",\"shouldDeployOnMobile\":true,\"showToNewVisitors\":true,\"showToNonSustainers\":true,\"showToReturningVisitors\":true,\"showToSustainers\":true,\"showTo\":\"both_logged_in_and_logged_out\",\"countriesToTarget\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-04T23:00:26.283Z\"}],\"he_modals\":[],\"en_sidebarAds\":[],\"he_sidebarAds\":[]}}\n"
